<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><i>Proforma
Information</i></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">The
table below presents selected proforma information for the Company for the year ended December 28, 2024, assuming that the acquisition
had occurred on January 1, 2023 (the beginning of the Company&#8217;s 2023 fiscal year), pursuant to ASC 805-10-50 (in $000&#8217;s).
This proforma information does not purport to represent what the actual results of operations of the Company would have been had the
acquisition occurred on that date, nor does it purport to predict the results of operations for future periods.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

