<td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 0.25in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><i><sup id="xdx_F09_zeMOHyR232a7">(1)</sup>&#160;</i></span></td><td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify"><span id="xdx_F2F_zpwOmjLtNEfk" style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">ALT5
                                            Sigma Corporation for the year ended December 28, 2024. Includes ALT5 Subsidiary from May
