</ix:nonNumeric><p id="xdx_8AD_zsqlNnEqKn68" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0.25in; text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.25in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0.25in; text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.25in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><i><span style="text-decoration: underline">Soin
Pharmaceuticals</span></i></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0.25in; text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.25in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Effective
January 24, 2024, the Company, Amol Soin M.D. (&#8220;Dr. Soin&#8221;), and Soin Therapeutics LLC, a wholly-owned subsidiary of the
Company that we had acquired from Dr. Soin, entered into an amendment (the &#8220;Soin Amendment&#8221;) to the parties&#8217;
Agreement and Plan of Merger that was dated as of December 28, 2022 (the &#8220;Soin Agreement&#8221;). With reference to the Soin
Agreement, the parties to the Soin Amendment agreed that the $<span id="xdx_909_eus-gaap--BusinessCombinationConsiderationTransferredEquityInterestsIssuedAndIssuable_pn6n6_c20240124__20240124__us-gaap--BusinessAcquisitionAxis__custom--SoinTherapeuticsLLCMember__us-gaap--ContingentConsiderationByTypeAxis__custom--SoinAgreementConvertibleTrancheOneMember_zTZflB9m9KHa" title="Business acquisition, shares issued, fair value"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:BusinessCombinationConsiderationTransferredEquityInterestsIssuedAndIssuable" contextRef="From2024-01-242024-01-24_custom_SoinTherapeuticsLLCMember_custom_SoinAgreementConvertibleTrancheOneMember" id="Fact001798" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-6" scale="6" unitRef="USD">3.0</ix:nonFraction></span>
million convertible tranche (the first of the <span id="xdx_906_ecustom--NumberOfTranches_iI_dc_c20240124__us-gaap--BusinessAcquisitionAxis__custom--SoinTherapeuticsLLCMember_zpfDbVWVF2gj" title="Number of tranches"><ix:nonFraction name="ALTS:NumberOfTranches" contextRef="AsOf2024-01-24_custom_SoinTherapeuticsLLCMember" id="Fact001800" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" decimals="INF" unitRef="Integer">three</ix:nonFraction></span>
original conversion tranches under the Soin Agreement) would be payable to Dr. Soin in cash rather than through his conversion of
such tranche of shares of the Series S Convertible Preferred Stock (the &#8220;Soin Preferred&#8221;) that constituted the
consideration under the Soin Agreement. The Company tendered the first $<span id="xdx_90D_eus-gaap--PaymentForContingentConsiderationLiabilityInvestingActivities_pn5n6_c20240301__20240330__us-gaap--BusinessAcquisitionAxis__custom--SoinTherapeuticsLLCMember__us-gaap--ContingentConsiderationByTypeAxis__custom--BusinessAcquisitionConsiderationTrancheOneMember_zcr1iAUEqT56" title="Business acquisition, shares issued, fair value"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:PaymentForContingentConsiderationLiabilityInvestingActivities" contextRef="From2024-03-012024-03-30_custom_SoinTherapeuticsLLCMember_custom_BusinessAcquisitionConsiderationTrancheOneMember" id="Fact001802" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-5" scale="6" unitRef="USD">0.1</ix:nonFraction></span>
million amended tranche cash payment to Dr. Soin in March 2024; the second amended tranche cash payment to Dr. Soin, also in the
amount of $<span id="xdx_906_eus-gaap--BusinessCombinationConsiderationTransferredLiabilitiesIncurred_pn5n6_c20240301__20240331__us-gaap--BusinessAcquisitionAxis__custom--SoinTherapeuticsLLCMember__us-gaap--ContingentConsiderationByTypeAxis__custom--BusinessAcquisitionConsiderationTrancheTwoMember_zocfc5PmeKne" title="Business acquisition, shares issued, fair value"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:BusinessCombinationConsiderationTransferredLiabilitiesIncurred" contextRef="From2024-03-012024-03-31_custom_SoinTherapeuticsLLCMember_custom_BusinessAcquisitionConsiderationTrancheTwoMember" id="Fact001804" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-5" scale="6" unitRef="USD">0.1</ix:nonFraction></span>
million, was due on July 1, 2024; ($<span id="xdx_906_eus-gaap--BusinessCombinationConsiderationTransferredEquityInterestsIssuedAndIssuable_c20240731__20240731__us-gaap--BusinessAcquisitionAxis__custom--SoinTherapeuticsLLCMember__us-gaap--ContingentConsiderationByTypeAxis__custom--SoinAgreementConvertibleTrancheOneMember_zeHZekxjrls1" title="Business acquisition, shares issued, fair value"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:BusinessCombinationConsiderationTransferredEquityInterestsIssuedAndIssuable" contextRef="From2024-07-312024-07-31_custom_SoinTherapeuticsLLCMember_custom_SoinAgreementConvertibleTrancheOneMember" id="Fact001806" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">50,000</ix:nonFraction></span> of which was tendered in July 2024); and the third amended tranche cash payment to Dr.
Soin, in the amount of $<span id="xdx_90A_eus-gaap--BusinessCombinationConsiderationTransferredLiabilitiesIncurred_pn5n6_c20240301__20240330__us-gaap--BusinessAcquisitionAxis__custom--SoinTherapeuticsLLCMember__us-gaap--ContingentConsiderationByTypeAxis__custom--BusinessAcquisitionConsiderationTrancheThreeMember_zWa6tm50seZi" title="Aggregate principal amount"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:BusinessCombinationConsiderationTransferredLiabilitiesIncurred" contextRef="From2024-03-012024-03-30_custom_SoinTherapeuticsLLCMember_custom_BusinessAcquisitionConsiderationTrancheThreeMember" id="Fact001808" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-5" scale="6" unitRef="USD">2.8</ix:nonFraction> </span>million,
was due on December 31, 2024. We tendered $<span id="xdx_904_eus-gaap--BusinessCombinationConsiderationTransferredEquityInterestsIssuedAndIssuable_c20250331__20250331__us-gaap--BusinessAcquisitionAxis__custom--SoinTherapeuticsLLCMember__us-gaap--ContingentConsiderationByTypeAxis__custom--SoinAgreementConvertibleTrancheOneMember_z0iR6WSCS1uh" title="Business acquisition, shares issued, fair value"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:BusinessCombinationConsiderationTransferredEquityInterestsIssuedAndIssuable" contextRef="From2025-03-312025-03-31_custom_SoinTherapeuticsLLCMember_custom_SoinAgreementConvertibleTrancheOneMember" id="Fact001810" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">350,000</ix:nonFraction></span> of the amended tranches to Dr. Soin in March 2025. During the pendency of the
amended cash tranche period, Dr. Soin agreed that he would not convert any of his shares of Soin Preferred. Dr. Soin, his conversion rights for the second and third original
conversion tranches remain convertible under the original provisions of the Soin Agreement and the related Certificate of Designation
for the Soin Preferred. If we do not tender the second and third amended tranche cash payments to Dr. Soin, we had agreed to transfer
to him the membership interests of Soin Therapeutics LLC, and he would transfer to us the shares of Soin Preferred for cancellation. As
of the date of this Report, Dr. Soin and the Company have a verbal agreement not to effectuate either such transfer. As of the year ended
December&#160;27, 2025, the Company has tendered an aggregate of $<span id="xdx_904_eus-gaap--PaymentsForLegalSettlements_pn5n6_c20241229__20251227__srt--CounterpartyNameAxis__custom--Dr.SoinMember_z7bAfUQ9pv71" title="Payments for legal settlements"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:PaymentsForLegalSettlements" contextRef="From2024-12-292025-12-27_custom_Dr.SoinMember" id="Fact001812" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-5" scale="6" unitRef="USD">0.5</ix:nonFraction></span>
million to Dr. Soin.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">In
connection with the Soin Amendment, the Company reclassified the $<span id="xdx_907_eus-gaap--BusinessCombinationConsiderationTransferredEquityInterestsIssuedAndIssuable_pn6n6_c20240124__20240124__us-gaap--BusinessAcquisitionAxis__custom--SoinTherapeuticsLLCMember__us-gaap--ContingentConsiderationByTypeAxis__custom--BusinessAcquisitionConsiderationTrancheOneMember_zz6e3mhzcgv3" title="Business acquisition, shares issued, fair value"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:BusinessCombinationConsiderationTransferredEquityInterestsIssuedAndIssuable" contextRef="From2024-01-242024-01-24_custom_SoinTherapeuticsLLCMember_custom_BusinessAcquisitionConsiderationTrancheOneMember" id="Fact001814" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-6" scale="6" unitRef="USD">3.0</ix:nonFraction></span> million convertible tranche, originally valued at approximately
$<span id="xdx_90C_eus-gaap--BusinessCombinationConsiderationTransferredEquityInterestsIssuedAndIssuable_pn5n6_c20221228__20221228__us-gaap--BusinessAcquisitionAxis__custom--SoinTherapeuticsLLCMember__us-gaap--ContingentConsiderationByTypeAxis__custom--BusinessAcquisitionConsiderationTrancheOneMember_zb32uJSH3q72" title="Business acquisition, shares issued, fair value"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:BusinessCombinationConsiderationTransferredEquityInterestsIssuedAndIssuable" contextRef="From2022-12-282022-12-28_custom_SoinTherapeuticsLLCMember_custom_BusinessAcquisitionConsiderationTrancheOneMember" id="Fact001816" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-5" scale="6" unitRef="USD">2.7</ix:nonFraction></span> million on our balance sheet, from mezzanine equity to current liabilities, and reclassified the $<span id="xdx_90F_eus-gaap--BusinessCombinationConsiderationTransferredEquityInterestsIssuedAndIssuable_pn6n6_c20240124__20240124__us-gaap--BusinessAcquisitionAxis__custom--SoinTherapeuticsLLCMember__us-gaap--ContingentConsiderationByTypeAxis__custom--BusinessAcquisitionConsiderationTrancheTwoMember_zJis7xYlKZ7f" title="Business acquisition, shares issued, fair value"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:BusinessCombinationConsiderationTransferredEquityInterestsIssuedAndIssuable" contextRef="From2024-01-242024-01-24_custom_SoinTherapeuticsLLCMember_custom_BusinessAcquisitionConsiderationTrancheTwoMember" id="Fact001818" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-6" scale="6" unitRef="USD">10.0</ix:nonFraction></span> million convertible tranche,
originally valued at approximately $<span id="xdx_900_eus-gaap--BusinessCombinationConsiderationTransferredEquityInterestsIssuedAndIssuable_pn6n6_c20221228__20221228__us-gaap--BusinessAcquisitionAxis__custom--SoinTherapeuticsLLCMember__us-gaap--ContingentConsiderationByTypeAxis__custom--BusinessAcquisitionConsiderationTrancheTwoMember_z4YEiMDWzPna" title="Business acquisition, shares issued, fair value"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:BusinessCombinationConsiderationTransferredEquityInterestsIssuedAndIssuable" contextRef="From2022-12-282022-12-28_custom_SoinTherapeuticsLLCMember_custom_BusinessAcquisitionConsiderationTrancheTwoMember" id="Fact001820" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-6" scale="6" unitRef="USD">8.0</ix:nonFraction></span> million on our balance sheet, to permanent equity. As of December 27, 2025, the outstanding balance
in mezzanine equity relates to the $<span id="xdx_90C_eus-gaap--BusinessCombinationConsiderationTransferredEquityInterestsIssuedAndIssuable_pn6n6_c20241229__20251227__us-gaap--BusinessAcquisitionAxis__custom--SoinTherapeuticsLLCMember__us-gaap--ContingentConsiderationByTypeAxis__custom--BusinessAcquisitionConsiderationTrancheThreeMember_zTsE7qQkqhIl" title="Business acquisition, shares issued, fair value"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:BusinessCombinationConsiderationTransferredEquityInterestsIssuedAndIssuable" contextRef="From2024-12-292025-12-27_custom_SoinTherapeuticsLLCMember_custom_BusinessAcquisitionConsiderationTrancheThreeMember" id="Fact001822" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-6" scale="6" unitRef="USD">17.0</ix:nonFraction></span> million convertible tranche originally valued at approximately $<span id="xdx_902_eus-gaap--BusinessCombinationConsiderationTransferredEquityInterestsIssuedAndIssuable_pn5n6_c20221228__20221228__us-gaap--BusinessAcquisitionAxis__custom--SoinTherapeuticsLLCMember__us-gaap--ContingentConsiderationByTypeAxis__custom--BusinessAcquisitionConsiderationTrancheThreeMember_zKIlgyLY9Vi3" title="Business acquisition, shares issued, fair value"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:BusinessCombinationConsiderationTransferredEquityInterestsIssuedAndIssuable" contextRef="From2022-12-282022-12-28_custom_SoinTherapeuticsLLCMember_custom_BusinessAcquisitionConsiderationTrancheThreeMember" id="Fact001824" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-5" scale="6" unitRef="USD">3.9</ix:nonFraction></span> million.</span></p>
<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"></p>

