</ix:nonNumeric><p id="xdx_8A8_zwjbdGmStM44" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Intangible
amortization expense for continuing operations was approximately $<span id="xdx_90B_eus-gaap--AmortizationOfIntangibleAssets_pn5n6_c20241229__20251227_zC3bKjeTTsF4" title="Intangible amortization expense"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:AmortizationOfIntangibleAssets" contextRef="From2024-12-29to2025-12-27" id="Fact002185" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-5" scale="6" unitRef="USD">3.3</ix:nonFraction></span> million and $<span id="xdx_90A_eus-gaap--AmortizationOfIntangibleAssets_pn5n6_c20231231__20241228_zdvJtN73YLU7" title="Intangible amortization expense"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:AmortizationOfIntangibleAssets" contextRef="From2023-12-312024-12-28" id="Fact002187" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-5" scale="6" unitRef="USD">1.3</ix:nonFraction></span> million, respectively, for the fiscal years ended
December 27, 2025 and December 28, 2024.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><span style="text-decoration: underline">Mswipe</span></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Effective
on May 9, 2025, the Company and its indirect, wholly-owned second tier Canadian subsidiary entered into an agreement to purchase all
of the outstanding capital stock of an entity that, through its subsidiaries, offers multi-currency, fiat- and crypto-enabled payment
card services (see Note 3).</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><span style="text-decoration: underline">Qoden
Intangible Assets</span></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">On
November 8, 2024, the Company acquired the Qodex Cryptocurrency Exchange Software platform and other related assets from Qoden Technologies,
LLC, a provider of technology solutions for the blockchain industry. The Company will amortize the intangible assets over a two<span id="xdx_908_eus-gaap--FiniteLivedIntangibleAssetUsefulLife_iI_pid_dtY_c20241108__us-gaap--AssetAcquisitionAxis__custom--QodenTechnologiesLLCMember__us-gaap--FiniteLivedIntangibleAssetsByMajorClassAxis__custom--QodenIntangibleMember_zQWNXAB5bU9c" title="Estimated useful life of intangible assets" style="display: none"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="AsOf2024-11-08_custom_QodenTechnologiesLLCMember_custom_QodenIntangibleMember" format="ixt-sec:duryear" id="Fact002189" name="us-gaap:FiniteLivedIntangibleAssetUsefulLife">2</ix:nonNumeric></span>-year
period (see Note 3).</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><span style="text-decoration: underline">ALT5
Subsidiary Intangible Assets</span></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">On
May 14, 2024, the Company acquired its ALT5 Subsidiary, which is a fintech company that provides next-generation blockchain-powered technologies
to enable a migration to a new global financial paradigm. As part of the acquisition, the Company acquired trade names, customer relationships,
and developed technology, which will be amortized over a period of <span id="xdx_904_eus-gaap--FiniteLivedIntangibleAssetUsefulLife_iI_pid_dc_c20240514__us-gaap--BusinessAcquisitionAxis__custom--ALT5SubsidiaryMember__us-gaap--FiniteLivedIntangibleAssetsByMajorClassAxis__us-gaap--TradeNamesMember_zCqbZQF8Qp68" title="Estimated useful life of intangible assets"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="AsOf2024-05-14_custom_ALT5SubsidiaryMember_us-gaap_TradeNamesMember" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" id="Fact002191" name="us-gaap:FiniteLivedIntangibleAssetUsefulLife">seven years</ix:nonNumeric></span>, <span id="xdx_909_eus-gaap--FiniteLivedIntangibleAssetUsefulLife_iI_pid_dtY_c20240514__us-gaap--BusinessAcquisitionAxis__custom--ALT5SubsidiaryMember__us-gaap--FiniteLivedIntangibleAssetsByMajorClassAxis__us-gaap--CustomerRelationshipsMember_zo0wc06hbo5l" title="Estimated useful life of intangible assets"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="AsOf2024-05-14_custom_ALT5SubsidiaryMember_us-gaap_CustomerRelationshipsMember" format="ixt-sec:duryear" id="Fact002193" name="us-gaap:FiniteLivedIntangibleAssetUsefulLife">10</ix:nonNumeric></span> years, and <span id="xdx_90E_eus-gaap--FiniteLivedIntangibleAssetUsefulLife_iI_pid_dc_c20240514__us-gaap--BusinessAcquisitionAxis__custom--ALT5SubsidiaryMember__us-gaap--FiniteLivedIntangibleAssetsByMajorClassAxis__us-gaap--DevelopedTechnologyRightsMember_zwL8Nw8SFWx7" title="Estimated useful life of intangible assets"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="AsOf2024-05-14_custom_ALT5SubsidiaryMember_us-gaap_DevelopedTechnologyRightsMember" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" id="Fact002195" name="us-gaap:FiniteLivedIntangibleAssetUsefulLife">five years</ix:nonNumeric></span>, respectively (see Note 3).</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>



<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"></p>

</ix:nonNumeric><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2024-12-29to2025-12-27" escape="true" id="Fact002197" name="us-gaap:GoodwillDisclosureTextBlock"><p id="xdx_800_eus-gaap--GoodwillDisclosureTextBlock_zC4jgllvyzj3" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><b>Note
10: <span id="xdx_82A_zJEoKt1uglEi">Goodwill</span></b></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

