<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">The
Company accounts for purchased goodwill and intangible assets in accordance with ASC 350, <i>Intangibles&#8212;Goodwill and Other</i>.
The Company recognized approximately $<span id="xdx_908_eus-gaap--GoodwillPeriodIncreaseDecrease_pn5n6_c20241229__20251227_zBy2LsgwvJ1c" title="Goodwill recognized"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:GoodwillPeriodIncreaseDecrease" contextRef="From2024-12-29to2025-12-27" id="Fact002231" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-5" scale="6" unitRef="USD">8.4</ix:nonFraction></span> million of goodwill during the year ended December 27, 2025 related to the acquisition of Mswipe
and the associated deferred tax liability (see Note 3).</span></p>
