</ix:nonNumeric><p id="xdx_8A1_zWdvKrXjp735" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">ALT5
Subsidiary issued <span id="xdx_904_ecustom--DebtInstrumentNumberOfDebenturesIssued_dc_uInteger_c20181001__20190930_zKxitZsoi025" title="Number of debentures issued"><ix:nonFraction name="ALTS:DebtInstrumentNumberOfDebenturesIssued" contextRef="From2018-10-012019-09-30" id="Fact002286" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" decimals="INF" unitRef="Integer">seven</ix:nonFraction></span> debentures over a period from October 2018 through September 2019. The debentures bore interest at <span id="xdx_902_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage_iI_pid_dp_uPure_c20251227__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--A12DebenturesMaturingJune302025Member__us-gaap--LongtermDebtTypeAxis__custom--DebenturesMember_zcIYPMPK8c1e" title="Debt interest rate (as percent)"><span title="Debt interest rate (as percent)"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" contextRef="AsOf2025-12-27_custom_A12DebenturesMaturingJune302025Member_custom_DebenturesMember" id="Fact002288" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">12</ix:nonFraction></span></span>% per annum
and matured on of June 30, 2025. During March 2026, <span id="xdx_907_ecustom--DebtInstrumentNumberOfDebenturesRepaid_dc_uInteger_c20260301__20260331__us-gaap--SubsequentEventTypeAxis__us-gaap--SubsequentEventMember_zYQupbE1qLDd" title="Number of debentures repaid"><ix:nonFraction name="ALTS:DebtInstrumentNumberOfDebenturesRepaid" contextRef="From2026-03-012026-03-31_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember" id="Fact002290" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" decimals="INF" unitRef="Integer">six</ix:nonFraction></span> of the debentures, representing approximately $<span id="xdx_90F_eus-gaap--RepaymentsOfDebt_pn5n6_c20260301__20260331__us-gaap--SubsequentEventTypeAxis__us-gaap--SubsequentEventMember_zWOuoeEMegNh" title="Repayments of debt"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:RepaymentsOfDebt" contextRef="From2026-03-012026-03-31_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember" id="Fact002292" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-5" scale="6" unitRef="USD">0.5</ix:nonFraction></span> million of the aggregate principal
amount, were settled through the issuance of <span id="xdx_90E_ecustom--IssuanceOfSharesOfCommonStock_pid_uShares_c20260301__20260331__us-gaap--SubsequentEventTypeAxis__us-gaap--SubsequentEventMember_zthDmxo7QxRl" title="Issuance of common stock"><ix:nonFraction name="ALTS:IssuanceOfSharesOfCommonStock" contextRef="From2026-03-012026-03-31_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember" id="Fact002294" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">114,328</ix:nonFraction></span> shares of the Company&#8217;s common stock. The remaining balance is currently being
negotiated for settlement with the sole remaining holder.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>



<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"></p>

