    <td style="border-bottom: Black 2.5pt double; text-align: left"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">$</span></td><td style="border-bottom: Black 2.5pt double; text-align: right"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:LongTermDebtNoncurrent" contextRef="AsOf2025-12-27_us-gaap_RelatedPartyMember" id="Fact002321" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="3" unitRef="USD">8,747</ix:nonFraction></span></td><td style="padding-bottom: 2.5pt; text-align: left"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">&#160;</span></td><td style="padding-bottom: 2.5pt"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">&#160;</span></td>
    <td style="border-bottom: Black 2.5pt double; text-align: left"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">$</span></td><td style="border-bottom: Black 2.5pt double; text-align: right"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:LongTermDebtNoncurrent" contextRef="AsOf2024-12-28_us-gaap_RelatedPartyMember" id="Fact002322" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="3" unitRef="USD">11,845</ix:nonFraction></span></td><td style="padding-bottom: 2.5pt; text-align: left"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">&#160;</span></td></tr>
  </table>

</ix:nonNumeric><p id="xdx_8AB_zCndCe3LFbZ1" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><b><span style="text-decoration: underline">Legacy
Subsidiary Fixed Deposits</span></b></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">During
the year ended December 27, 2025, ALT5 Subsidiary entered into several Corporate Fixed Deposit Agreements with otherwise unaffiliated
third-parties, pursuant to which the Company became obligated for an aggregate of $<span id="xdx_901_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentFaceAmount_iI_pn5n6_c20251227__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--LegacySubsidiaryFixedDepositsMember__us-gaap--LongtermDebtTypeAxis__custom--FixedDepositAgreementMember__dei--LegalEntityAxis__custom--ALT5SubsidiaryMember_zgWX6ZIJPMA5" title="Debt face amount"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentFaceAmount" contextRef="AsOf2025-12-27_custom_LegacySubsidiaryFixedDepositsMember_custom_FixedDepositAgreementMember_custom_ALT5SubsidiaryMember" id="Fact002324" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-5" scale="6" unitRef="USD">4.7</ix:nonFraction></span> million, as set forth in the respective agreements.
Each obligation bears interest at a rate of <span id="xdx_90C_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage_iI_dp_uPure_c20251227__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--LegacySubsidiaryFixedDepositsMember__us-gaap--LongtermDebtTypeAxis__custom--FixedDepositAgreementMember__dei--LegalEntityAxis__custom--ALT5SubsidiaryMember__srt--RangeAxis__srt--MinimumMember_z528tp8R8yN8" title="Debt interest rate"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" contextRef="AsOf2025-12-27_custom_LegacySubsidiaryFixedDepositsMember_custom_FixedDepositAgreementMember_custom_ALT5SubsidiaryMember_srt_MinimumMember" id="Fact002326" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">13</ix:nonFraction></span>% or <span id="xdx_908_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage_iI_dp_uPure_c20251227__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--LegacySubsidiaryFixedDepositsMember__us-gaap--LongtermDebtTypeAxis__custom--FixedDepositAgreementMember__dei--LegalEntityAxis__custom--ALT5SubsidiaryMember__srt--RangeAxis__srt--MaximumMember_zp1Rl6QKZpng" title="Debt interest rate"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" contextRef="AsOf2025-12-27_custom_LegacySubsidiaryFixedDepositsMember_custom_FixedDepositAgreementMember_custom_ALT5SubsidiaryMember_srt_MaximumMember" id="Fact002328" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">15</ix:nonFraction></span>% per annum, and has a maturity date range of March 18, 2026 to March 13, 2027.
During the year ended December 27, 2025, several of these unaffiliated third-parties agreed to convert their respective investments into
Future Equity Agreements for shares of the Company&#8217;s subsidiary, Alyea and, consequently, approximately $<span id="xdx_90A_eus-gaap--DebtConversionOriginalDebtAmount1_pn3n3_c20241229__20251227__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--LegacySubsidiaryFixedDepositsMember__us-gaap--LongtermDebtTypeAxis__custom--FixedDepositAgreementMember__dei--LegalEntityAxis__custom--ALT5SubsidiaryMember_zOXSRlI3yGzl" title="Debt conversion, converted amount"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtConversionOriginalDebtAmount1" contextRef="From2024-12-292025-12-27_custom_LegacySubsidiaryFixedDepositsMember_custom_FixedDepositAgreementMember_custom_ALT5SubsidiaryMember" id="Fact002330" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="3" unitRef="USD">475,000</ix:nonFraction></span> of
these deposits were reclassified as non-controlling interest. As of December 27, 2025 and December 28, 2024, the outstanding aggregate
obligations totaled approximately $<span id="xdx_901_eus-gaap--LongTermDebt_iI_pn5n6_c20251227__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--LegacySubsidiaryFixedDepositsMember__us-gaap--LongtermDebtTypeAxis__custom--FixedDepositAgreementMember__dei--LegalEntityAxis__custom--ALT5SubsidiaryMember_zDXflMkMmwId" title="Total debentures"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:LongTermDebt" contextRef="AsOf2025-12-27_custom_LegacySubsidiaryFixedDepositsMember_custom_FixedDepositAgreementMember_custom_ALT5SubsidiaryMember" id="Fact002332" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-5" scale="6" unitRef="USD">7.9</ix:nonFraction></span> million and $<span id="xdx_902_eus-gaap--LongTermDebt_iI_pn5n6_c20241228__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--LegacySubsidiaryFixedDepositsMember__us-gaap--LongtermDebtTypeAxis__custom--FixedDepositAgreementMember__dei--LegalEntityAxis__custom--ALT5SubsidiaryMember_z94iGLY7Qch" title="Total debentures"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:LongTermDebt" contextRef="AsOf2024-12-28_custom_LegacySubsidiaryFixedDepositsMember_custom_FixedDepositAgreementMember_custom_ALT5SubsidiaryMember" id="Fact002334" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-5" scale="6" unitRef="USD">4.5</ix:nonFraction></span> million, respectively.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><b><span style="text-decoration: underline">Legacy
Subsidiary Loan</span></b></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">On
August 10, 2023, ALT5 Subsidiary entered into a Bitcoin-denominated promissory note with an otherwise unaffiliated third party. The note
is remeasured to fair value each reporting period. Although an extension agreement was contemplated, no such agreement was executed.
The promissory note had an original maturity date of August 2025 and was fully repaid during the year ended December 27, 2025. The promissory
note bore interest at <span id="xdx_90E_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage_iI_dp_uPure_c20251227__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--LegacySubsidiaryFixedDepositsMember__us-gaap--LongtermDebtTypeAxis__us-gaap--LoansPayableMember__us-gaap--RelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis__us-gaap--RelatedPartyMember_z8vN0whnd2db" title="Debt interest rate"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" contextRef="AsOf2025-12-27_custom_LegacySubsidiaryFixedDepositsMember_us-gaap_LoansPayableMember_us-gaap_RelatedPartyMember" id="Fact002336" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">15</ix:nonFraction></span>% per annum. As of December 27, 2025 and December 28, 2024, the outstanding balance of the note was approximately
$<span id="xdx_907_eus-gaap--LongTermDebt_iI_pn5n6_c20251227__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--LegacySubsidiaryFixedDepositsMember__us-gaap--LongtermDebtTypeAxis__us-gaap--LoansPayableMember__us-gaap--RelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis__us-gaap--RelatedPartyMember_zrPxPRoTMKt4" title="Total debentures"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:LongTermDebt" contextRef="AsOf2025-12-27_custom_LegacySubsidiaryFixedDepositsMember_us-gaap_LoansPayableMember_us-gaap_RelatedPartyMember" id="Fact002338" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-5" scale="6" unitRef="USD">0</ix:nonFraction></span> and $<span id="xdx_909_eus-gaap--LongTermDebt_iI_pn5n6_c20241228__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--LegacySubsidiaryFixedDepositsMember__us-gaap--LongtermDebtTypeAxis__us-gaap--LoansPayableMember__us-gaap--RelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis__us-gaap--RelatedPartyMember_ztwg1YAzDfM8" title="Total debentures"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:LongTermDebt" contextRef="AsOf2024-12-28_custom_LegacySubsidiaryFixedDepositsMember_us-gaap_LoansPayableMember_us-gaap_RelatedPartyMember" id="Fact002340" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-5" scale="6" unitRef="USD">3.8</ix:nonFraction></span> million, respectively.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"></p>

