<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"></p><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: center"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><b>ALT5
                                            SIGMA CORPORATION</b></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: center"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><b>NOTES
TO CONSOLIDATED FINANCIAL STATEMENTS</b></span></p>


<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><b><span style="text-decoration: underline">Unaffiliated
Third-Party Loans</span></b></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><b><i><span style="text-decoration: underline">ICG
Note</span></i></b></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">On
February 7, 2024, the Company amended its related-party promissory note in favor of Isaac Capital Group LLC (&#8220;ICG&#8221;) (the
&#8220;ICG Note&#8221;) to add a conversion feature. In accordance with Nasdaq rules, the per-share conversion price was set at $<span id="xdx_90D_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentConvertibleConversionPrice1_iI_uUSDPShares_c20240207__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--ICGNoteMember__us-gaap--LongtermDebtTypeAxis__custom--PromissoryNoteMember__us-gaap--RelatedPartyTransactionAxis__custom--NotesPayableWithLiveVenturesAndICGMember__us-gaap--RelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis__us-gaap--RelatedPartyMember_zc8SvuWiGNoh" title="Conversion price"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentConvertibleConversionPrice1" contextRef="AsOf2024-02-07_custom_ICGNoteMember_custom_PromissoryNoteMember_custom_NotesPayableWithLiveVenturesAndICGMember_us-gaap_RelatedPartyMember" id="Fact002342" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="USDPShares">0.61</ix:nonFraction></span>,
subject to customary adjustments for (i) stock dividends and splits, (ii) subsequent rights offerings, and (iii) pro rata distributions.
The Company&#8217;s board of directors approved the amendment on February 7, 2024. On March 6, 2024, ICG entered into a Note Purchase
Agreement with an otherwise unaffiliated third party, under which the third party acquired the ICG Note. The terms of the ICG Note were
not modified in connection with the transfer. The principal amount outstanding on the date of acquisition was approximately $<span id="xdx_90E_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentFaceAmount_iI_pn5n6_c20240207__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--ICGNoteMember__us-gaap--LongtermDebtTypeAxis__custom--PromissoryNoteMember__us-gaap--RelatedPartyTransactionAxis__custom--NotesPayableWithLiveVenturesAndICGMember__us-gaap--RelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis__us-gaap--RelatedPartyMember_zhmafKxERxd8" title="Debt face amount"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentFaceAmount" contextRef="AsOf2024-02-07_custom_ICGNoteMember_custom_PromissoryNoteMember_custom_NotesPayableWithLiveVenturesAndICGMember_us-gaap_RelatedPartyMember" id="Fact002344" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-5" scale="6" unitRef="USD">1.2</ix:nonFraction></span> million.
During the year ended December 27, 2025, the third party converted approximately $<span id="xdx_90B_eus-gaap--DebtConversionOriginalDebtAmount1_pn5n6_c20241229__20251227__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--ICGNoteMember__us-gaap--LongtermDebtTypeAxis__custom--PromissoryNoteMember__us-gaap--RelatedPartyTransactionAxis__custom--NotesPayableWithLiveVenturesAndICGMember__us-gaap--RelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis__us-gaap--RelatedPartyMember_zi1TsozMEIM9" title="Debt conversion, converted amount"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtConversionOriginalDebtAmount1" contextRef="From2024-12-292025-12-27_custom_ICGNoteMember_custom_PromissoryNoteMember_custom_NotesPayableWithLiveVenturesAndICGMember_us-gaap_RelatedPartyMember" id="Fact002346" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-5" scale="6" unitRef="USD">1.2</ix:nonFraction></span> million of the Company&#8217;s obligations under
the ICG Note into <span id="xdx_908_eus-gaap--DebtConversionConvertedInstrumentSharesIssued1_pn5n6_uShares_c20241229__20251227__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--ICGNoteMember__us-gaap--LongtermDebtTypeAxis__custom--PromissoryNoteMember__us-gaap--RelatedPartyTransactionAxis__custom--NotesPayableWithLiveVenturesAndICGMember__us-gaap--RelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis__us-gaap--RelatedPartyMember_zW3G31q2WpSb" title="Debt conversion, converted shares"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtConversionConvertedInstrumentSharesIssued1" contextRef="From2024-12-292025-12-27_custom_ICGNoteMember_custom_PromissoryNoteMember_custom_NotesPayableWithLiveVenturesAndICGMember_us-gaap_RelatedPartyMember" id="Fact002348" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-5" scale="6" unitRef="Shares">1.9</ix:nonFraction></span> million shares of the Company&#8217;s common stock. As of December 27, 2025 and December 28, 2024, the amount outstanding
on the ICG Note was approximately $<span id="xdx_90C_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentCarryingAmount_iI_pn3n3_c20251227__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--ICGNoteMember__us-gaap--LongtermDebtTypeAxis__custom--PromissoryNoteMember__us-gaap--RelatedPartyTransactionAxis__custom--NotesPayableWithLiveVenturesAndICGMember__us-gaap--RelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis__us-gaap--RelatedPartyMember_zlzLp2fFauk9" title="Principal outstanding balance"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentCarryingAmount" contextRef="AsOf2025-12-27_custom_ICGNoteMember_custom_PromissoryNoteMember_custom_NotesPayableWithLiveVenturesAndICGMember_us-gaap_RelatedPartyMember" id="Fact002350" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="3" unitRef="USD">26,000</ix:nonFraction></span> and $<span id="xdx_906_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentCarryingAmount_iI_pn5n6_c20241228__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--ICGNoteMember__us-gaap--LongtermDebtTypeAxis__custom--PromissoryNoteMember__us-gaap--RelatedPartyTransactionAxis__custom--NotesPayableWithLiveVenturesAndICGMember__us-gaap--RelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis__us-gaap--RelatedPartyMember_z0sX2AE2U8A4" title="Principal outstanding balance"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentCarryingAmount" contextRef="AsOf2024-12-28_custom_ICGNoteMember_custom_PromissoryNoteMember_custom_NotesPayableWithLiveVenturesAndICGMember_us-gaap_RelatedPartyMember" id="Fact002352" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-5" scale="6" unitRef="USD">0.7</ix:nonFraction></span> million, respectively.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>



<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><b><i><span style="text-decoration: underline">Live
Note</span></i></b></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">On
February 7, 2024, the Company amended its related-party promissory note in favor of Live Ventures Incorporated (&#8220;Live&#8221;) (the
&#8220;Live Note&#8221;) to add a conversion feature. In accordance with Nasdaq rules, the per-share conversion price for each amended
obligation was set at $<span id="xdx_901_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentConvertibleConversionPrice1_iI_uUSDPShares_c20240207__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--LiveNoteMember__us-gaap--LongtermDebtTypeAxis__custom--PromissoryNoteMember__us-gaap--RelatedPartyTransactionAxis__custom--NotesPayableWithLiveVenturesAndICGMember__us-gaap--RelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis__us-gaap--RelatedPartyMember_znVWqGpC6wxf" title="Conversion price"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentConvertibleConversionPrice1" contextRef="AsOf2024-02-07_custom_LiveNoteMember_custom_PromissoryNoteMember_custom_NotesPayableWithLiveVenturesAndICGMember_us-gaap_RelatedPartyMember" id="Fact002354" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="USDPShares">0.61</ix:nonFraction></span>, subject to customary adjustments for (i) stock dividends and splits, (ii) subsequent rights offerings, and
(iii) pro rata distributions. The Company&#8217;s board of directors approved the amendments on February 7, 2024. On March 6, 2024, Live
entered into a Note Purchase Agreement with an otherwise unaffiliated third party, under which the third party acquired the Live Note.
The terms of the Live Note were not modified in connection with the transfer. The principal amount outstanding on the date of acquisition
was approximately $<span id="xdx_90B_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentFaceAmount_iI_pn5n6_c20240207__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--LiveNoteMember__us-gaap--LongtermDebtTypeAxis__custom--PromissoryNoteMember__us-gaap--RelatedPartyTransactionAxis__custom--NotesPayableWithLiveVenturesAndICGMember__us-gaap--RelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis__us-gaap--RelatedPartyMember_zdrdKXiMf1k2" title="Debt face amount"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentFaceAmount" contextRef="AsOf2024-02-07_custom_LiveNoteMember_custom_PromissoryNoteMember_custom_NotesPayableWithLiveVenturesAndICGMember_us-gaap_RelatedPartyMember" id="Fact002356" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-5" scale="6" unitRef="USD">1.0</ix:nonFraction></span> million. During the year ended December 27, 2025, the third party converted $<span id="xdx_907_eus-gaap--DebtConversionOriginalDebtAmount1_pn5n6_c20241229__20251227__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--LiveNoteMember__us-gaap--LongtermDebtTypeAxis__custom--PromissoryNoteMember__us-gaap--RelatedPartyTransactionAxis__custom--NotesPayableWithLiveVenturesAndICGMember__us-gaap--RelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis__us-gaap--RelatedPartyMember_zvrCmTLKiiJl" title="Debt conversion, converted amount"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtConversionOriginalDebtAmount1" contextRef="From2024-12-292025-12-27_custom_LiveNoteMember_custom_PromissoryNoteMember_custom_NotesPayableWithLiveVenturesAndICGMember_us-gaap_RelatedPartyMember" id="Fact002358" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-5" scale="6" unitRef="USD">1.0</ix:nonFraction></span> million of the Company&#8217;s
obligations under the Live Note into approximately <span id="xdx_90E_eus-gaap--DebtConversionConvertedInstrumentSharesIssued1_pn5n6_uShares_c20241229__20251227__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--LiveNoteMember__us-gaap--LongtermDebtTypeAxis__custom--PromissoryNoteMember__us-gaap--RelatedPartyTransactionAxis__custom--NotesPayableWithLiveVenturesAndICGMember__us-gaap--RelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis__us-gaap--RelatedPartyMember_znk6j7CIm2O7" title="Debt conversion, converted shares"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtConversionConvertedInstrumentSharesIssued1" contextRef="From2024-12-292025-12-27_custom_LiveNoteMember_custom_PromissoryNoteMember_custom_NotesPayableWithLiveVenturesAndICGMember_us-gaap_RelatedPartyMember" id="Fact002360" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-5" scale="6" unitRef="Shares">1.6</ix:nonFraction></span> million shares of the Company&#8217;s common stock. As of September 27, 2025 and
December 28, 2024, the amount outstanding on the Live Note was $<span id="xdx_901_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentCarryingAmount_iI_pn5n6_c20250927__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--LiveNoteMember__us-gaap--LongtermDebtTypeAxis__custom--PromissoryNoteMember__us-gaap--RelatedPartyTransactionAxis__custom--NotesPayableWithLiveVenturesAndICGMember__us-gaap--RelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis__us-gaap--RelatedPartyMember_zfQhbsZ4sVIf" title="Principal outstanding balance"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentCarryingAmount" contextRef="AsOf2025-09-27_custom_LiveNoteMember_custom_PromissoryNoteMember_custom_NotesPayableWithLiveVenturesAndICGMember_us-gaap_RelatedPartyMember" id="Fact002362" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-5" scale="6" unitRef="USD">0</ix:nonFraction></span> and $<span id="xdx_909_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentCarryingAmount_iI_pn5n6_c20241228__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--LiveNoteMember__us-gaap--LongtermDebtTypeAxis__custom--PromissoryNoteMember__us-gaap--RelatedPartyTransactionAxis__custom--NotesPayableWithLiveVenturesAndICGMember__us-gaap--RelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis__us-gaap--RelatedPartyMember_zwoh9Qu0IMg9" title="Principal outstanding balance"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentCarryingAmount" contextRef="AsOf2024-12-28_custom_LiveNoteMember_custom_PromissoryNoteMember_custom_NotesPayableWithLiveVenturesAndICGMember_us-gaap_RelatedPartyMember" id="Fact002364" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-5" scale="6" unitRef="USD">0.8</ix:nonFraction></span> million.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><b><i><span style="text-decoration: underline">Big/Small
Debentures</span></i></b></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">On
August 20, 2024, the Company entered into <span id="xdx_90C_ecustom--NumberOfUnaffiliatedThirdPartyInvestors_iI_dc_uInteger_c20240820__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--NonConvertibleDebentureBigDebentureMember__us-gaap--LongtermDebtTypeAxis__us-gaap--UnsecuredDebtMember_zeYVXM6y7x3g" title="Number Of unaffiliated third-party investors"><ix:nonFraction name="ALTS:NumberOfUnaffiliatedThirdPartyInvestors" contextRef="AsOf2024-08-20_custom_NonConvertibleDebentureBigDebentureMember_us-gaap_UnsecuredDebtMember" id="Fact002366" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" decimals="INF" unitRef="Integer">three</ix:nonFraction></span> Purchase Agreements with three otherwise unaffiliated third-party investors (the &#8220;Investors&#8221;),
pursuant to which (1) one Investor agreed to purchase a unit (the &#8220;Unit&#8221;), consisting of (i) a non-convertible debenture
in the principal amount of up to approximately $<span id="xdx_907_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentFaceAmount_iI_pn5n6_c20240820__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--NonConvertibleDebentureBigDebentureMember__us-gaap--LongtermDebtTypeAxis__us-gaap--UnsecuredDebtMember__srt--CounterpartyNameAxis__custom--InvestorOneMember_zVjQL8oZtyeh" title="Debt face amount"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentFaceAmount" contextRef="AsOf2024-08-20_custom_NonConvertibleDebentureBigDebentureMember_us-gaap_UnsecuredDebtMember_custom_InvestorOneMember" id="Fact002368" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-5" scale="6" unitRef="USD">1.8</ix:nonFraction></span> million (the &#8220;Big Debenture&#8221;), and (ii) a warrant (the &#8220;Big Warrant&#8221;)
for the purchase of up to <span id="xdx_909_eus-gaap--ClassOfWarrantOrRightNumberOfSecuritiesCalledByWarrantsOrRights_iI_pid_uShares_c20240820__us-gaap--ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis__custom--BigWarrantMember__srt--CounterpartyNameAxis__custom--InvestorOneMember_zWsOMyiue5ph" title="Warrant excise and granted, shares"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightNumberOfSecuritiesCalledByWarrantsOrRights" contextRef="AsOf2024-08-20_custom_BigWarrantMember_custom_InvestorOneMember" id="Fact002370" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">400,000</ix:nonFraction></span> shares of the Company&#8217;s Common Stock and (2) the two other Investors each agreed to purchase
a Unit, consisting of (i) a non-convertible debenture in the principal amount of up to $<span id="xdx_903_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentFaceAmount_iI_pn3n3_c20240820__us-gaap--ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis__custom--BigWarrantMember__srt--CounterpartyNameAxis__custom--InvestorTwoAndInvestorThreeMember__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--NonConvertibleDebentureSmallDebentureMember__us-gaap--LongtermDebtTypeAxis__us-gaap--UnsecuredDebtMember_zEJ96Ct2kR18" title="Debt face amount"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentFaceAmount" contextRef="AsOf2024-08-20_custom_BigWarrantMember_custom_InvestorTwoAndInvestorThreeMember_custom_NonConvertibleDebentureSmallDebentureMember_us-gaap_UnsecuredDebtMember" id="Fact002372" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="3" unitRef="USD">405,454</ix:nonFraction></span> (the &#8220;Small Debenture&#8221;, and,
together with the Big Debenture, the &#8220;Debentures&#8221;) and (ii) a warrant (the &#8220;Small Warrant&#8221;, and, together with
the Big Warrant, the &#8220;Warrants&#8221;) for the purchase of up <span id="xdx_90D_eus-gaap--ClassOfWarrantOrRightNumberOfSecuritiesCalledByWarrantsOrRights_iI_pid_uShares_c20240820__us-gaap--ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis__us-gaap--WarrantMember__srt--CounterpartyNameAxis__custom--InvestorTwoAndInvestorThreeMember_zvtbDTNMo6vb" title="Warrant excise and granted, shares"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightNumberOfSecuritiesCalledByWarrantsOrRights" contextRef="AsOf2024-08-20_us-gaap_WarrantMember_custom_InvestorTwoAndInvestorThreeMember" id="Fact002374" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">90,909</ix:nonFraction></span> shares of Common Stock.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">The
Debentures are unsecured and subordinated to any existing or future debt. The Debentures bear interest at a rate of (i) <span id="xdx_903_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage_iI_dp_uPure_c20240820__us-gaap--LongtermDebtTypeAxis__us-gaap--UnsecuredDebtMember__srt--CounterpartyNameAxis__custom--InvestorTwoAndInvestorThreeMember__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--DebtInstrumentCovenantPeriodPeriodOneMember_z6joKtSJOloe" title="Debt interest rate"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" contextRef="AsOf2024-08-20_us-gaap_UnsecuredDebtMember_custom_InvestorTwoAndInvestorThreeMember_custom_DebtInstrumentCovenantPeriodPeriodOneMember" id="Fact002376" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">1</ix:nonFraction></span>% per month
from and after August 20, 2024 (&#8220;Original Issue Date&#8221;) through and including October 31, 2024, (ii) <span id="xdx_900_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage_iI_dp_uPure_c20240820__us-gaap--LongtermDebtTypeAxis__us-gaap--UnsecuredDebtMember__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentRedemptionPeriodAxis__custom--DebtInstrumentCovenantPeriodPeriodTwoMember__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--NonConvertibleDebentureBigAndSmallDebentureMember_zIBxI4E7Txtk" title="Debt interest rate"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" contextRef="AsOf2024-08-20_us-gaap_UnsecuredDebtMember_custom_DebtInstrumentCovenantPeriodPeriodTwoMember_custom_NonConvertibleDebentureBigAndSmallDebentureMember" id="Fact002378" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">3</ix:nonFraction></span>% per month from and
after November 1, 2024 through and including January 29, 2025, and (iii) <span id="xdx_908_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage_iI_dp_uPure_c20240820__us-gaap--LongtermDebtTypeAxis__us-gaap--UnsecuredDebtMember__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentRedemptionPeriodAxis__custom--DebtInstrumentCovenantPeriodPeriodThreeMember__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--NonConvertibleDebentureBigAndSmallDebentureMember_zSWhb63YQQUc" title="Debt interest rate"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" contextRef="AsOf2024-08-20_us-gaap_UnsecuredDebtMember_custom_DebtInstrumentCovenantPeriodPeriodThreeMember_custom_NonConvertibleDebentureBigAndSmallDebentureMember" id="Fact002380" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">4</ix:nonFraction></span>% per month from and after January 30, 2025 through and including
the date of repayment.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">The
Big Debenture was issued with an original issue discount (an &#8220;OID&#8221;) initially of $<span id="xdx_904_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentUnamortizedDiscount_iI_dc_c20240820__us-gaap--LongtermDebtTypeAxis__us-gaap--UnsecuredDebtMember__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--NonConvertibleDebentureBigDebenturesMember_zBrotL4tUfBd" title="Original issue discount"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentUnamortizedDiscount" contextRef="AsOf2024-08-20_us-gaap_UnsecuredDebtMember_custom_NonConvertibleDebentureBigDebenturesMember" id="Fact002382" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">171,000</ix:nonFraction></span>, which OID can be expanded with
up to <span id="xdx_90A_ecustom--DebtInstrumentOriginalIssueDiscountNumberOfPotentialAdditions_iI_dc_c20240820__us-gaap--LongtermDebtTypeAxis__us-gaap--UnsecuredDebtMember__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--NonConvertibleDebentureBigDebentureMember_zchISKVOGqzg" title="Number of potential additions"><ix:nonFraction name="ALTS:DebtInstrumentOriginalIssueDiscountNumberOfPotentialAdditions" contextRef="AsOf2024-08-20_custom_NonConvertibleDebentureBigDebentureMember_us-gaap_UnsecuredDebtMember" id="Fact002384" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" decimals="INF" unitRef="Integer">two</ix:nonFraction></span> potential additions, the first in the amount of $<span id="xdx_904_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentUnamortizedDiscount_iI_dc_c20240820__us-gaap--LongtermDebtTypeAxis__us-gaap--UnsecuredDebtMember__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--NonConvertibleDebentureBigDebenturesMember_zQBKoUOS7Yqe" title="Original issue discount"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentUnamortizedDiscount" contextRef="AsOf2024-08-20_us-gaap_UnsecuredDebtMember_custom_NonConvertibleDebentureBigDebenturesMember" id="Fact002386" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">171,000</ix:nonFraction></span> and, thereafter, in the amount of $<span id="xdx_906_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentUnamortizedDiscount_iI_pn3n3_c20240820__us-gaap--LongtermDebtTypeAxis__custom--UnsecuredDebtTwoMember__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--NonConvertibleDebentureBigDebentureMember_z84tSrcDKAh4" title="Original issue discount"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentUnamortizedDiscount" contextRef="AsOf2024-08-20_custom_UnsecuredDebtTwoMember_custom_NonConvertibleDebentureBigDebentureMember" id="Fact002388" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="3" unitRef="USD">342,000</ix:nonFraction></span>, which OIDs will increase
the principal amount owing on the Big Debenture. With the original OID, the initial principal amount owing under the Big Debenture is
approximately $<span id="xdx_905_eus-gaap--LongTermDebt_iI_pn5n6_c20240820__us-gaap--LongtermDebtTypeAxis__custom--UnsecuredDebtTwoMember__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--NonConvertibleDebentureBigDebentureMember_zXPQ8EgzNS4g" title="Total debentures"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:LongTermDebt" contextRef="AsOf2024-08-20_custom_UnsecuredDebtTwoMember_custom_NonConvertibleDebentureBigDebentureMember" id="Fact002390" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-5" scale="6" unitRef="USD">1.3</ix:nonFraction></span> million; if, expanded, the principal amount would increase to approximately $<span id="xdx_908_eus-gaap--LongTermDebt_iI_pn5n6_c20240820__us-gaap--LongtermDebtTypeAxis__us-gaap--UnsecuredDebtMember__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--NonConvertibleDebentureBigDebentureMember__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentRedemptionPeriodAxis__custom--DebtInstrumentOriginalIssueDiscountExpansionOneMember_zu8GKeH2yWac" title="Total debentures"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:LongTermDebt" contextRef="AsOf2024-08-20_us-gaap_UnsecuredDebtMember_custom_NonConvertibleDebentureBigDebentureMember_custom_DebtInstrumentOriginalIssueDiscountExpansionOneMember" id="Fact002392" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-5" scale="6" unitRef="USD">1.4</ix:nonFraction></span> million and, thereafter, potentially
to approximately $<span id="xdx_903_eus-gaap--LongTermDebt_iI_pn5n6_c20240820__us-gaap--LongtermDebtTypeAxis__us-gaap--UnsecuredDebtMember__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--NonConvertibleDebentureBigDebentureMember__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentRedemptionPeriodAxis__custom--DebtInstrumentOriginalIssueDiscountExpansionTwoMember_zmP5pTzmDM2i" title="Total debentures"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:LongTermDebt" contextRef="AsOf2024-08-20_us-gaap_UnsecuredDebtMember_custom_NonConvertibleDebentureBigDebentureMember_custom_DebtInstrumentOriginalIssueDiscountExpansionTwoMember" id="Fact002394" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-5" scale="6" unitRef="USD">1.8</ix:nonFraction></span> million. The first potential increase in the Big Debenture OID would occur if the initial principal amount and
interest accrued thereon is not paid in full on or before October 31, 2024. The second potential increase in the OID would occur if the
initial principal amount (including the first potential increase in the OID) and interest accrued thereon is not paid in full on or before
January 29, 2025.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>



<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">The
Small Debentures were issued with an OID initially of $<span id="xdx_907_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentUnamortizedDiscount_iI_pn3n3_c20240820__us-gaap--LongtermDebtTypeAxis__us-gaap--UnsecuredDebtMember__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--NonConvertibleDebentureSmallDebentureMember_zPKa5TFFffdf" title="Original issue discount"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentUnamortizedDiscount" contextRef="AsOf2024-08-20_us-gaap_UnsecuredDebtMember_custom_NonConvertibleDebentureSmallDebentureMember" id="Fact002396" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="3" unitRef="USD">38,863</ix:nonFraction></span>, which OID can be expanded with up to <span id="xdx_907_ecustom--DebtInstrumentOriginalIssueDiscountNumberOfPotentialAdditions_iI_dc_c20240820__us-gaap--LongtermDebtTypeAxis__us-gaap--UnsecuredDebtMember__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--NonConvertibleDebentureSmallDebentureMember_zWnlQQGomhNa" title="Number of potential additions"><ix:nonFraction name="ALTS:DebtInstrumentOriginalIssueDiscountNumberOfPotentialAdditions" contextRef="AsOf2024-08-20_us-gaap_UnsecuredDebtMember_custom_NonConvertibleDebentureSmallDebentureMember" id="Fact002398" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" decimals="INF" unitRef="Integer">two</ix:nonFraction></span> potential additions, the first
in the amount of $<span id="xdx_909_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentUnamortizedDiscount_iI_pn3n3_c20240820__us-gaap--LongtermDebtTypeAxis__us-gaap--UnsecuredDebtMember__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--NonConvertibleDebentureSmallDebentureMember__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentRedemptionPeriodAxis__custom--DebtInstrumentOriginalIssueDiscountExpansionOneMember_zjM1Pd2FAKrd" title="Original issue discount"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentUnamortizedDiscount" contextRef="AsOf2024-08-20_us-gaap_UnsecuredDebtMember_custom_NonConvertibleDebentureSmallDebentureMember_custom_DebtInstrumentOriginalIssueDiscountExpansionOneMember" id="Fact002400" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="3" unitRef="USD">38,863</ix:nonFraction></span> and, thereafter, in the amount of $<span id="xdx_90F_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentUnamortizedDiscount_iI_pn3n3_c20240820__us-gaap--LongtermDebtTypeAxis__us-gaap--UnsecuredDebtMember__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--NonConvertibleDebentureSmallDebentureMember__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentRedemptionPeriodAxis__custom--DebtInstrumentOriginalIssueDiscountExpansionTwoMember_zLTBUTC4xOM3" title="Original issue discount"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentUnamortizedDiscount" contextRef="AsOf2024-08-20_us-gaap_UnsecuredDebtMember_custom_NonConvertibleDebentureSmallDebentureMember_custom_DebtInstrumentOriginalIssueDiscountExpansionTwoMember" id="Fact002402" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="3" unitRef="USD">77,728</ix:nonFraction></span>, which OIDs will increase the principal amount owing on the Small
Debentures. With the original OID, the initial principal amount owing under a Small Debenture is $<span id="xdx_906_eus-gaap--LongTermDebt_iI_pn3n3_c20240820__us-gaap--LongtermDebtTypeAxis__us-gaap--UnsecuredDebtMember__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--NonConvertibleDebentureSmallDebentureMember_zZvVZ6S1c4l1" title="Total debentures"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:LongTermDebt" contextRef="AsOf2024-08-20_us-gaap_UnsecuredDebtMember_custom_NonConvertibleDebentureSmallDebentureMember" id="Fact002404" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="3" unitRef="USD">288,864</ix:nonFraction></span>; if, expanded, the principal
amount would increase to $<span id="xdx_908_eus-gaap--LongTermDebt_iI_pn3n3_c20240820__us-gaap--LongtermDebtTypeAxis__us-gaap--UnsecuredDebtMember__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--NonConvertibleDebentureSmallDebentureMember__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentRedemptionPeriodAxis__custom--DebtInstrumentOriginalIssueDiscountExpansionOneMember_zpXkfr3VwKDk" title="Total debentures"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:LongTermDebt" contextRef="AsOf2024-08-20_us-gaap_UnsecuredDebtMember_custom_NonConvertibleDebentureSmallDebentureMember_custom_DebtInstrumentOriginalIssueDiscountExpansionOneMember" id="Fact002406" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="3" unitRef="USD">327,726</ix:nonFraction></span> and, thereafter, potentially to $<span id="xdx_90F_eus-gaap--LongTermDebt_iI_pn3n3_c20240820__us-gaap--LongtermDebtTypeAxis__us-gaap--UnsecuredDebtMember__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--NonConvertibleDebentureSmallDebentureMember__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentRedemptionPeriodAxis__custom--DebtInstrumentOriginalIssueDiscountExpansionTwoMember_zq7D5NRADhWf" title="Total debentures"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:LongTermDebt" contextRef="AsOf2024-08-20_us-gaap_UnsecuredDebtMember_custom_NonConvertibleDebentureSmallDebentureMember_custom_DebtInstrumentOriginalIssueDiscountExpansionTwoMember" id="Fact002408" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="3" unitRef="USD">405,454</ix:nonFraction></span>. The first potential increase in the Small Debenture OID would
occur if the initial principal amount and interest accrued thereon is not paid in full on or before October 31, 2024. The second potential
increase in the OID would occur if the initial principal amount (including the first potential increase in the OID) and interest accrued
thereon is not paid in full on or before January 29, 2025.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"></p>

<ix:exclude><!-- Field: Page; Sequence: 60; Value: 1 -->
    <div style="border-bottom: Black 1pt solid; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 6pt"><table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; font-size: 10pt"><tr style="vertical-align: top; text-align: left"><td style="text-align: center; width: 100%">F-<!-- Field: Sequence; Type: Arabic; Name: PageNo -->25<!-- Field: /Sequence --></td></tr></table></div>
