<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"></p><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: center"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><b>ALT5
                                            SIGMA CORPORATION</b></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: center"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><b>NOTES
TO CONSOLIDATED FINANCIAL STATEMENTS</b></span></p>


<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">On
April 18, 2024, ICG made a short-term demand advance to the Company in the amount of $<span id="xdx_902_eus-gaap--ProceedsFromShortTermDebt_c20240418__20240418__us-gaap--RelatedPartyTransactionAxis__custom--ICGNoteMember__us-gaap--LongtermDebtTypeAxis__us-gaap--NotesPayableOtherPayablesMember__us-gaap--RelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis__us-gaap--RelatedPartyMember__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--IsaacCapitalGroupShortTermDemandAdvanceMember_z1ezpmGyq702" title="Proceeds from short-term demand advances"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ProceedsFromShortTermDebt" contextRef="From2024-04-182024-04-18_custom_ICGNoteMember_us-gaap_NotesPayableOtherPayablesMember_us-gaap_RelatedPartyMember_custom_IsaacCapitalGroupShortTermDemandAdvanceMember" id="Fact002529" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">100,000</ix:nonFraction></span>. The advance bears interest at a rate of
<span id="xdx_903_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage_iI_pid_dp_uPure_c20240418__us-gaap--RelatedPartyTransactionAxis__custom--ICGNoteMember__us-gaap--LongtermDebtTypeAxis__us-gaap--NotesPayableOtherPayablesMember__us-gaap--RelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis__us-gaap--RelatedPartyMember__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--IsaacCapitalGroupShortTermDemandAdvanceMember_zssZa5250n1b" title="Debt interest rate"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" contextRef="AsOf2024-04-18_custom_ICGNoteMember_us-gaap_NotesPayableOtherPayablesMember_us-gaap_RelatedPartyMember_custom_IsaacCapitalGroupShortTermDemandAdvanceMember" id="Fact002531" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">10</ix:nonFraction></span>% per annum until repaid. As of December 27, 2025 and December 28, 2024, the principal amount outstanding was $<span id="xdx_907_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentCarryingAmount_iI_c20251227__us-gaap--RelatedPartyTransactionAxis__custom--ICGNoteMember__us-gaap--LongtermDebtTypeAxis__us-gaap--NotesPayableOtherPayablesMember__us-gaap--RelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis__us-gaap--RelatedPartyMember__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--IsaacCapitalGroupShortTermDemandAdvanceMember_zdptTrwM12yb" title="Principle outstanding balance"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentCarryingAmount" contextRef="AsOf2025-12-27_custom_ICGNoteMember_us-gaap_NotesPayableOtherPayablesMember_us-gaap_RelatedPartyMember_custom_IsaacCapitalGroupShortTermDemandAdvanceMember" id="Fact002533" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">0</ix:nonFraction></span> and $<span id="xdx_90E_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentCarryingAmount_iI_c20241228__us-gaap--RelatedPartyTransactionAxis__custom--ICGNoteMember__us-gaap--LongtermDebtTypeAxis__us-gaap--NotesPayableOtherPayablesMember__us-gaap--RelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis__us-gaap--RelatedPartyMember__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--IsaacCapitalGroupShortTermDemandAdvanceMember_z5IHsYmEZImb" title="Principle outstanding balance"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentCarryingAmount" contextRef="AsOf2024-12-28_custom_ICGNoteMember_us-gaap_NotesPayableOtherPayablesMember_us-gaap_RelatedPartyMember_custom_IsaacCapitalGroupShortTermDemandAdvanceMember" id="Fact002535" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">48,000</ix:nonFraction></span>, respectively
(see Note 19).</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><b><span style="text-decoration: underline">Live
Ventures Incorporated</span></b></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">On
February 7, 2024, the Company amended its outstanding related party promissory obligations (the &#8220;Live Note&#8221;) in favor of
Live Ventures to add a convertibility provision. In accordance with Nasdaq Rules, the per-share conversion price for each obligation,
as amended, was set at $<span id="xdx_90E_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentConvertibleConversionPrice1_iI_c20240207__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--ICGNoteMember__us-gaap--LongtermDebtTypeAxis__us-gaap--NotesPayableOtherPayablesMember__us-gaap--RelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis__us-gaap--RelatedPartyMember__us-gaap--RelatedPartyTransactionAxis__custom--LiveVentureIncorporatedMember_zEFZHdbyZmw9" title="Conversion price"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentConvertibleConversionPrice1" contextRef="AsOf2024-02-07_custom_ICGNoteMember_us-gaap_NotesPayableOtherPayablesMember_us-gaap_RelatedPartyMember_custom_LiveVentureIncorporatedMember" id="Fact002537" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="USDPShares">0.61</ix:nonFraction></span>, subject to standard adjustments for (i) stock dividends and splits, (ii) subsequent rights offerings, and
(iii) pro rata distributions. The Company&#8217;s board of directors provided its final approvals of the amendments on February 7, 2024.
On March 6, 2024, Live Ventures entered into a Note Purchase Agreement with another otherwise unaffiliated third party, under which under
which the third party acquired the Live Note. The terms and conditions of the acquired Live Note were not modified in connection with
its acquisition by the third party. The principal amount of the Live Note on the date of acquisition was approximately $<span id="xdx_902_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentFaceAmount_iI_pn6n6_c20240207__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--ICGNoteMember__us-gaap--LongtermDebtTypeAxis__us-gaap--NotesPayableOtherPayablesMember__us-gaap--RelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis__us-gaap--RelatedPartyMember__us-gaap--RelatedPartyTransactionAxis__custom--LiveVentureIncorporatedMember_z0vjUgUqW5R4" title="Debt face amount"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentFaceAmount" contextRef="AsOf2024-02-07_custom_ICGNoteMember_us-gaap_NotesPayableOtherPayablesMember_us-gaap_RelatedPartyMember_custom_LiveVentureIncorporatedMember" id="Fact002539" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-6" scale="6" unitRef="USD">1.0</ix:nonFraction></span> million.
During the fiscal year ended December 27, 2025, the third party converted approximately $<span id="xdx_90E_eus-gaap--DebtConversionOriginalDebtAmount1_pn3n3_c20241229__20251227__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--LiveNoteMember__us-gaap--LongtermDebtTypeAxis__us-gaap--NotesPayableOtherPayablesMember__us-gaap--RelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis__us-gaap--RelatedPartyMember__us-gaap--RelatedPartyTransactionAxis__custom--LiveVentureIncorporatedMember_zLHHwBsMIs1" title="Debt conversion, converted amount"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtConversionOriginalDebtAmount1" contextRef="From2024-12-292025-12-27_custom_LiveNoteMember_us-gaap_NotesPayableOtherPayablesMember_us-gaap_RelatedPartyMember_custom_LiveVentureIncorporatedMember" id="Fact002541" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="3" unitRef="USD">347,000</ix:nonFraction></span> of the Company&#8217;s obligation under
the Live Note into <span id="xdx_901_eus-gaap--DebtConversionConvertedInstrumentSharesIssued1_c20241229__20251227__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--LiveNoteMember__us-gaap--LongtermDebtTypeAxis__us-gaap--NotesPayableOtherPayablesMember__us-gaap--RelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis__us-gaap--RelatedPartyMember__us-gaap--RelatedPartyTransactionAxis__custom--LiveVentureIncorporatedMember_zxgv8eOhGbL6" title="Debt conversion, converted"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtConversionConvertedInstrumentSharesIssued1" contextRef="From2024-12-292025-12-27_custom_LiveNoteMember_us-gaap_NotesPayableOtherPayablesMember_us-gaap_RelatedPartyMember_custom_LiveVentureIncorporatedMember" id="Fact002543" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">568,470</ix:nonFraction></span> shares of the Company&#8217;s common stock. As of December 27, 2025 and December 28, 2024, the amount outstanding
on the Live Note was $<span id="xdx_909_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentConvertibleConversionPrice1_iI_c20251227__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--LiveNoteMember__us-gaap--LongtermDebtTypeAxis__us-gaap--NotesPayableOtherPayablesMember__us-gaap--RelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis__us-gaap--RelatedPartyMember__us-gaap--RelatedPartyTransactionAxis__custom--LiveVentureIncorporatedMember_zScX5WMHalzg" title="Debt face amount"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentConvertibleConversionPrice1" contextRef="AsOf2025-12-27_custom_LiveNoteMember_us-gaap_NotesPayableOtherPayablesMember_us-gaap_RelatedPartyMember_custom_LiveVentureIncorporatedMember" id="Fact002545" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="USDPShares">0</ix:nonFraction></span> and $<span id="xdx_907_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentConvertibleConversionPrice1_iI_pn6n6_c20241228__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--LiveNoteMember__us-gaap--LongtermDebtTypeAxis__us-gaap--NotesPayableOtherPayablesMember__us-gaap--RelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis__us-gaap--RelatedPartyMember__us-gaap--RelatedPartyTransactionAxis__custom--LiveVentureIncorporatedMember_zBAC6oeoLVVf" title="Debt face amount"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentConvertibleConversionPrice1" contextRef="AsOf2024-12-28_custom_LiveNoteMember_us-gaap_NotesPayableOtherPayablesMember_us-gaap_RelatedPartyMember_custom_LiveVentureIncorporatedMember" id="Fact002547" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-6" scale="6" unitRef="USDPShares">327,000</ix:nonFraction></span>, respectively (see Note 19).</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><b><span style="text-decoration: underline">Novalk
Apps SAA, LLP</span></b></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">On
May 28, 2024 and June 3, 2024, Novalk Apps SAA, LLP (&#8220;Novalk&#8221;) made short-term demand advances in the amount of $<span id="xdx_90B_eus-gaap--ProceedsFromShortTermDebt_c20240528__20240528__srt--CounterpartyNameAxis__custom--NovalkAppsSAALLPMember__us-gaap--RelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis__us-gaap--RelatedPartyMember__us-gaap--RelatedPartyTransactionAxis__custom--RelatedPartyTransactionShortTermAdvancesMember_zVwRd89NByTa" title="Proceeds from short-term demand advances"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ProceedsFromShortTermDebt" contextRef="From2024-05-282024-05-28_custom_NovalkAppsSAALLPMember_us-gaap_RelatedPartyMember_custom_RelatedPartyTransactionShortTermAdvancesMember" id="Fact002549" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">120,000</ix:nonFraction></span>
and $<span id="xdx_904_eus-gaap--ProceedsFromShortTermDebt_c20240603__20240603__srt--CounterpartyNameAxis__custom--NovalkAppsSAALLPMember__us-gaap--RelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis__us-gaap--RelatedPartyMember__us-gaap--RelatedPartyTransactionAxis__custom--RelatedPartyTransactionShortTermAdvancesMember_zyPwml6r0P4j" title="Proceeds from short-term demand advances"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ProceedsFromShortTermDebt" contextRef="From2024-06-032024-06-03_custom_NovalkAppsSAALLPMember_us-gaap_RelatedPartyMember_custom_RelatedPartyTransactionShortTermAdvancesMember" id="Fact002551" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">100,000</ix:nonFraction></span>, respectively, to the Company. The advances bears interest at a rate of <span id="xdx_900_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage_iI_pid_dp_uPure_c20240528__srt--CounterpartyNameAxis__custom--NovalkAppsSAALLPMember__us-gaap--RelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis__us-gaap--RelatedPartyMember__us-gaap--RelatedPartyTransactionAxis__custom--RelatedPartyTransactionShortTermAdvancesMember_zlCUTWFbXth9" title="Debt interest rate"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" contextRef="AsOf2024-05-28_custom_NovalkAppsSAALLPMember_us-gaap_RelatedPartyMember_custom_RelatedPartyTransactionShortTermAdvancesMember" id="Fact002553" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">10</ix:nonFraction></span>% per annum until repaid. As of December 27, 2025
and December 28, 2024, the principal amount outstanding was $<span id="xdx_90D_eus-gaap--ShortTermBorrowings_iI_c20251227__srt--CounterpartyNameAxis__custom--NovalkAppsSAALLPMember__us-gaap--RelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis__us-gaap--RelatedPartyMember__us-gaap--RelatedPartyTransactionAxis__custom--RelatedPartyTransactionShortTermAdvancesMember_zGZxRNrYGTp1" title="Short term debt"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShortTermBorrowings" contextRef="AsOf2025-12-27_custom_NovalkAppsSAALLPMember_us-gaap_RelatedPartyMember_custom_RelatedPartyTransactionShortTermAdvancesMember" id="Fact002555" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">0</ix:nonFraction></span> and $<span id="xdx_901_eus-gaap--ShortTermBorrowings_iI_c20241228__srt--CounterpartyNameAxis__custom--NovalkAppsSAALLPMember__us-gaap--RelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis__us-gaap--RelatedPartyMember__us-gaap--RelatedPartyTransactionAxis__custom--RelatedPartyTransactionShortTermAdvancesMember_z68HbjKyVirc" title="Short term debt"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShortTermBorrowings" contextRef="AsOf2024-12-28_custom_NovalkAppsSAALLPMember_us-gaap_RelatedPartyMember_custom_RelatedPartyTransactionShortTermAdvancesMember" id="Fact002557" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">110,000</ix:nonFraction></span>, respectively (see Note 19).</span></p>
<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

</ix:nonNumeric><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2024-12-29to2025-12-27" escape="true" id="Fact002559" name="ALTS:RegisteredDirectOfferingDisclosureTextBlock"><p id="xdx_808_ecustom--RegisteredDirectOfferingDisclosureTextBlock_zS8Z9T17Mmed" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><b>Note
15: <span id="xdx_82D_zkDSIBL69Y43">Registered Direct Offering</span></b></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><b><i><span style="text-decoration: underline">Registered
Direct Offering</span></i></b></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">On
or about August 12, 2025, the Company entered into securities purchase agreements (the &#8220;Registered Offering Purchase Agreements&#8221;)
with certain institutional investors, pursuant to which the Company agreed to issue to the Purchasers (as defined therein), in a registered
direct offering (the &#8220;Registered Offering&#8221;), an aggregate of <span id="xdx_902_eus-gaap--SaleOfStockNumberOfSharesIssuedInTransaction_c20250812__20250812__us-gaap--SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis__custom--RegisteredDirectOfferingMember_zvz8XJ3crgZc" title="Number of shares issued"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:SaleOfStockNumberOfSharesIssuedInTransaction" contextRef="From2025-08-122025-08-12_custom_RegisteredDirectOfferingMember" id="Fact002561" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">100,000,000</ix:nonFraction></span> shares of the Company&#8217;s common stock, par
value $<span id="xdx_909_eus-gaap--CommonStockParOrStatedValuePerShare_iI_c20250812__us-gaap--SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis__custom--RegisteredDirectOfferingMember_zdEwwVulcVge" title="Common stock, par value"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:CommonStockParOrStatedValuePerShare" contextRef="AsOf2025-08-12_custom_RegisteredDirectOfferingMember" id="Fact002563" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="USDPShares">0.001</ix:nonFraction></span> per share (&#8220;Common Stock&#8221;), at a purchase price of $<span id="xdx_90E_eus-gaap--SaleOfStockPricePerShare_iI_c20250812__us-gaap--SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis__custom--RegisteredDirectOfferingMember_zcHgdR3sxJy4" title="Offering price"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:SaleOfStockPricePerShare" contextRef="AsOf2025-08-12_custom_RegisteredDirectOfferingMember" id="Fact002565" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="USDPShares">7.50</ix:nonFraction></span> per share.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">The
Company intends to use up to $<span id="xdx_908_ecustom--SaleOfStockConsiderationToBeReceivedOnTransactionDesignated_iI_pn5n6_c20250812__us-gaap--SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis__custom--RegisteredDirectOfferingMember_zVI6oQRWOqe3" title="Net proceeds intended to be used for litigation and debt settlement and funding existing operations"><ix:nonFraction name="ALTS:SaleOfStockConsiderationToBeReceivedOnTransactionDesignated" contextRef="AsOf2025-08-12_custom_RegisteredDirectOfferingMember" id="Fact002567" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-5" scale="6" unitRef="USD">10.0</ix:nonFraction></span> million of the net proceeds from the Registered Offering to settle existing litigation, pay existing
debt, and fund the Company&#8217;s existing business operations. The balance of the net proceeds was used to fund the acquisition of
$WLFI tokens from World Liberty Financial, Inc. (the &#8220;Lead Investor&#8221;), pursuant to a Token Purchase Agreement, and the establishment
of the Company&#8217;s cryptocurrency treasury operations. The shares of Common Stock issued in the Registered Offering were issued pursuant
to a prospectus supplement, which was filed with the SEC on August 11, 2025, in connection with a takedown from the Company&#8217;s shelf
registration statement on Form S-3, as amended, (File No. 333-289176), which was declared effective by the SEC on August 8, 2025.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><i>Private
Placement Offering</i></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">In addition,
on August 12, 2025, the Company consummated transactions resulting from a Securities Purchase Agreement (the &#8220;Private Placement
Purchase Agreement&#8221; and, together with the Registered Offering Purchase Agreements, the &#8220;Purchase Agreements&#8221;), with
the Lead Investor, pursuant to which the Company received $<span id="xdx_90A_eus-gaap--SaleOfStockConsiderationReceivedOnTransaction_pn6n6_c20250812__20250812__us-gaap--SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis__us-gaap--PrivatePlacementMember_zKuavXUFVtJ6" title="Sale of stock, aggregate price"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:SaleOfStockConsiderationReceivedOnTransaction" contextRef="From2025-08-122025-08-12_us-gaap_PrivatePlacementMember" id="Fact002569" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-6" scale="6" unitRef="USD">750</ix:nonFraction></span> million of $WLFI tokens and issued to the Lead Investor, in a concurrent
private placement (the &#8220;Private Placement&#8221; and together with the Registered Offering, the &#8220;Offerings&#8221;), <span id="xdx_90E_eus-gaap--SaleOfStockNumberOfSharesIssuedInTransaction_c20250812__20250812__us-gaap--SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis__us-gaap--PrivatePlacementMember_z5xt36FAObX2" title="Number of shares issued"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:SaleOfStockNumberOfSharesIssuedInTransaction" contextRef="From2025-08-122025-08-12_us-gaap_PrivatePlacementMember" id="Fact002571" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">1,000,000</ix:nonFraction></span>
shares of Common Stock at a purchase price of $<span id="xdx_90A_eus-gaap--SaleOfStockPricePerShare_iI_c20250812__us-gaap--SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis__us-gaap--PrivatePlacementMember_zJUSx15mQ4O4" title="Offering price"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:SaleOfStockPricePerShare" contextRef="AsOf2025-08-12_us-gaap_PrivatePlacementMember" id="Fact002573" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="USDPShares">7.50</ix:nonFraction></span> per share (the &#8220;PIPE Shares&#8221;), and pre-funded warrants (the &#8220;PIPE
Pre-Funded Warrants&#8221;) to purchase up to <span id="xdx_907_eus-gaap--ClassOfWarrantOrRightNumberOfSecuritiesCalledByWarrantsOrRights_iI_c20250812__us-gaap--SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis__us-gaap--PrivatePlacementMember__us-gaap--ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis__custom--PreFundedWarrantsMember_zzJAv3lNu8Rj" title="Warrants granted"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightNumberOfSecuritiesCalledByWarrantsOrRights" contextRef="AsOf2025-08-12_us-gaap_PrivatePlacementMember_custom_PreFundedWarrantsMember" id="Fact002575" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">99,000,000</ix:nonFraction></span> shares of Common Stock at a purchase price of $<span id="xdx_906_ecustom--ClassOfWarrantPurchasePricePerShare_c20250812__20250812__us-gaap--SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis__us-gaap--PrivatePlacementMember__us-gaap--ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis__custom--PreFundedWarrantsMember_zJXav5fEdNXa" title="Class of warrant"><ix:nonFraction name="ALTS:ClassOfWarrantPurchasePricePerShare" contextRef="From2025-08-122025-08-12_us-gaap_PrivatePlacementMember_custom_PreFundedWarrantsMember" id="Fact002577" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="USDPShares">7.499</ix:nonFraction></span> per PIPE Pre-Funded Warrant
(the &#8220;PIPE Pre-Funded Warrant Shares&#8221;). Each of the PIPE Pre-Funded Warrants is exercisable for <span id="xdx_909_eus-gaap--ClassOfWarrantOrRightNumberOfSecuritiesCalledByEachWarrantOrRight_iI_dc_c20250812__us-gaap--SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis__us-gaap--PrivatePlacementMember__us-gaap--ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis__custom--PreFundedWarrantsMember_zom77Zgtm4jl" title="Number of shares callable for each warrant"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightNumberOfSecuritiesCalledByEachWarrantOrRight" contextRef="AsOf2025-08-12_us-gaap_PrivatePlacementMember_custom_PreFundedWarrantsMember" id="Fact002579" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">one</ix:nonFraction></span> share of Common Stock
at an exercise price of $<span id="xdx_901_eus-gaap--ClassOfWarrantOrRightExercisePriceOfWarrantsOrRights1_iI_c20250812__us-gaap--SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis__us-gaap--PrivatePlacementMember__us-gaap--ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis__custom--PreFundedWarrantsMember_zgSVBgSC22Fd" title="Warrant exercise price"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightExercisePriceOfWarrantsOrRights1" contextRef="AsOf2025-08-12_us-gaap_PrivatePlacementMember_custom_PreFundedWarrantsMember" id="Fact002581" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="USDPShares">0.001</ix:nonFraction></span> per share. The PIPE Pre-Funded Warrants were not exercisable until the Company had (i) obtained stockholder
approval to allow the issuance of shares underlying the PIPE Pre-Funded Warrant in excess of <span id="xdx_905_ecustom--ClassOfWarrantOrRightExercisableExchangeCapThreshold_iI_pid_dp_uPure_c20250812__us-gaap--SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis__us-gaap--PrivatePlacementMember__us-gaap--ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis__custom--PreFundedWarrantsMember_zIkhCZypecHi" title="Exchange cap threshold"><ix:nonFraction name="ALTS:ClassOfWarrantOrRightExercisableExchangeCapThreshold" contextRef="AsOf2025-08-12_us-gaap_PrivatePlacementMember_custom_PreFundedWarrantsMember" id="Fact002583" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">19.99</ix:nonFraction></span>% of the shares of common stock outstanding
immediately prior to the execution of the Purchase Agreement (the &#8220;Exchange Cap&#8221;) and (ii) filed an amendment to its Articles
of Incorporation to increase the number of authorized shares of common stock (the &#8220;Amendment&#8221;), both of which occurred in
October 2025. Accordingly, the PIPE Pre-Funded Warrants may be exercised at any time until all have been exercised in full, subject to
certain contractual beneficial ownership limitations.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"></p>

<ix:exclude><!-- Field: Page; Sequence: 63; Value: 1 -->
