18: <span id="xdx_82B_zYrHEI91Rop3">Income taxes</span></b></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">For
fiscal years ended December 27, 2025, and December 28, 2024, the Company recorded an income tax benefit from continuing operations of
approximately $<span id="xdx_904_eus-gaap--IncomeTaxExpenseBenefit_pn5n6_c20241229__20251227__us-gaap--StatementOperatingActivitiesSegmentAxis__us-gaap--SegmentContinuingOperationsMember_zGQQwnF06iDg" title="Income tax benefit"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:IncomeTaxExpenseBenefit" contextRef="From2024-12-292025-12-27_us-gaap_SegmentContinuingOperationsMember" id="Fact002937" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-5" scale="6" unitRef="USD">87.6</ix:nonFraction></span> million and $<span id="xdx_903_eus-gaap--IncomeTaxExpenseBenefit_pn5n6_c20231231__20241228__us-gaap--StatementOperatingActivitiesSegmentAxis__us-gaap--SegmentContinuingOperationsMember_zJ9iVcUie9G8" title="Income tax benefit"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:IncomeTaxExpenseBenefit" contextRef="From2023-12-312024-12-28_us-gaap_SegmentContinuingOperationsMember" id="Fact002939" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-5" scale="6" unitRef="USD">0.2</ix:nonFraction></span> million, respectively, and an income tax benefit from discontinued operations
of $<span id="xdx_90A_eus-gaap--IncomeTaxExpenseBenefit_pn5n6_c20241229__20251227__us-gaap--StatementOperatingActivitiesSegmentAxis__us-gaap--SegmentDiscontinuedOperationsMember_zT4DsnKORR1e" title="Income tax benefit"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:IncomeTaxExpenseBenefit" contextRef="From2024-12-292025-12-27_us-gaap_SegmentDiscontinuedOperationsMember" id="Fact002941" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-5" scale="6" unitRef="USD">0.9</ix:nonFraction></span> million and approximately $<span id="xdx_909_eus-gaap--IncomeTaxExpenseBenefit_pn5n6_c20231231__20241228__us-gaap--StatementOperatingActivitiesSegmentAxis__us-gaap--SegmentDiscontinuedOperationsMember_z1wmRNBF1nce" title="Income tax benefit"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:IncomeTaxExpenseBenefit" contextRef="From2023-12-312024-12-28_us-gaap_SegmentDiscontinuedOperationsMember" id="Fact002943" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-5" scale="6" unitRef="USD">2.9</ix:nonFraction></span> million, respectively, which consisted of the following (in $000&#8217;s):</span></p>

